# FX Regime Lab — Quick Reference

## Read First
- **Master manifest:** `.agent/index.json`
- **Code map:** `.agent/maps/CODEMAP.json`
- **Hot files:** `.agent/context/HOTFILES.md`
- **Current sprint:** `TASK.md`

## Hard Rules
- **3-pair lock:** EUR/USD, USD/JPY, USD/INR ONLY
- **All DB writes** → `pipeline/src/db/writer.py` ONLY
- **All AI calls** → `pipeline/src/ai/client.py` (ON HOLD)
- **Immutable ledger:** `regime_calls` + `validation_log` append-only
- **No GitHub Actions** — Prefect Cloud only
- **Tests:** `pytest` 121 + `npm run build` zero errors

## File Map
| Need to... | Go to... |
|------------|----------|
| Add fetcher | `pipeline/src/fetchers/` |
| Add signal | `pipeline/src/signals/` |
| Change regime | `pipeline/src/regime/` or `pipeline/src/logic/` |
| Change 3-layer math | `pipeline/src/logic/layer{1,2,3}_*.py` |
| Change AI prompts | `pipeline/src/ai/client.py` (ON HOLD) |
| Write to DB | `pipeline/src/db/writer.py` |
| Change frontend | `web/src/` |
| Add migration | `supabase/migrations/` |
| Change worker | `workers/site-entry.js` |
| Change deployment | `pipeline/prefect.yaml` |

## Design Tokens
- **Swiss Monochrome:** `#000000` bg, white text, 1px borders
- **No rounded corners, no shadows**
- **EUR/USD:** `#4da6ff`, **USD/JPY:** `#ff9944`, **USD/INR:** `#e74c3c`
- **All financial numbers:** `tabular-nums`

## Delegation
```bash
# Single task
./scripts/cursor-delegate.sh --spec spec.md --yolo

# Multi-task pipeline
./scripts/kimi-cursor-orchestrator.sh --process-queue --parallel 3 --yolo
```
